Third-party material in this repository:
- listen/mcq.py ports VoiceBench's multiple-choice answer extraction (MatthewCYM/VoiceBench, src/evaluator/mcq.py,
  Apache-2.0).
- samples/question.wav is a spoken question from VoiceBench (hlt-lab/voicebench, OpenBookQA subset, Apache-2.0).
- bench/librittsr50.jsonl lists 50 LibriTTS-R test-clean utterances with their texts (LibriTTS-R, CC-BY-4.0).

Models downloaded at run time are not part of this repository and keep their own licenses, among them NVIDIA
Parakeet (CC-BY-4.0) and the chosen LLM (for example Qwen3, Apache-2.0).
